{%- comment -%}
  FLINT — WORDMARK (Brand Manual §12)

  Custom drawn. Five letters, all built from straight strokes, with the
  knapped serif: a flat faceted plane cut at a shallow angle instead of a
  bracket. Do not re-set this in a typeface. Do not re-track it.

  Usage:
    {% render 'flint-logo', colour: '#2A2724', width: '148px' %}

  Permitted colours: Flint #2A2724 · Limewash #FAF7F2 · Chalk #F1ECE3
  Brass is for physical production only — foil, engraving, signage. Never screen.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign fill = colour | default: '#2A2724'
  assign w = width | default: '148px'
-%}

